Z||000004||Mach10||11-28-2001||12:58 AM||||Nice thought, but the motor would fall apart on you  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>You CAN build up a 2.5, but you sure as hell better know what you're doing, or else you end up with a big pig of slag. There's numerous weak-points in the Iron Duke that have to be addressed if you wish to do anything competitive with it.<BR>||||reg||7
